    "# Interactive Libra Demo: Machine Learning in One Line\n",
    "\n",
    "Welcome to the interactive Libra demo! This notebook showcases how Libra makes machine learning accessible to everyone - from complete beginners to experienced data scientists.\n",
    "\n",
    "## What is Libra?\n",
    "\n",
    "Libra is a Python library that automates the entire machine learning process with just one line of code. It handles:\n",
    "- Data preprocessing\n",
    "- Model selection\n",
    "- Hyperparameter tuning\n",
    "- Training and evaluation\n",
    "- Predictions\n",
    "\n",
    "## Installation\n",
    "\n",
    "First, let's install Libra and other required packages:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Install required packages\n",
